# Implementation Plan: Organize ZimaOS Setup Files

The goal is to consolidate all ZimaOS setup and configuration files into the `d:\OS\Zimaos` directory, which is mapped to the `evatechnosoft/zimaSetup` repository. This will involve moving files from the parent `D:\OS` directory and ensuring the git repository reflects the desired structure.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component] File Organization

#### [MOVE] [cloudflare_token.txt](file:///D:/OS/cloudflare_token.txt) to [D:\OS\Zimaos\cloudflare_token.txt](file:///D:/OS/Zimaos/cloudflare_token.txt)
#### [MOVE] [daemon.json](file:///D:/OS/daemon.json) to [D:\OS\Zimaos\daemon.json](file:///D:/OS/Zimaos/daemon.json)
#### [MOVE] [setup.sh](file:///D:/OS/setup.sh) to [D:\OS\Zimaos\setup.sh](file:///D:/OS/Zimaos/setup.sh) [OVERWRITE]
#### [MOVE] [zimasetup.md](file:///D:/OS/zimasetup.md) to [D:\OS\Zimaos\zimasetup.md](file:///D:/OS/Zimaos/zimasetup.md) [OVERWRITE]

## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- Run `ls -R d:\OS\Zimaos` to verify all files are present.
- Run `git status` in `d:\OS\Zimaos` to ensure changes are tracked.

### Manual Verification
- Confirm with the user that the files are in the correct location.
